         <div xml:id="jdso8u-d1e2372"><!-- jdso8u-b3d1prae -->
            <head xml:id="jdso8u-d1e2372-Hd1e99">Praeambulum</head>
            <p xml:id="jdso8u-d1e2372-d1e101">
               <lb ed="#V" n="16"/>Postquam Magister in primo libro
    <lb ed="#V" n="17"/>determinavit de Deo, quantum ad 
    ra<lb ed="#V" n="18" break="no"/>tionem suae naturalis perfectionis,
    <lb ed="#V" n="19"/>ut generare et spirare; et in 
    secun<lb ed="#V" n="20" break="no"/>do libro determinavit de ipso 
    in<lb ed="#V" n="21" break="no"/>quantum ejus perfectio relucet in
    <lb ed="#V" n="22"/>operibus creationis ; in hoc tertio
    <lb ed="#V" n="23"/>determinat de Deo inquantum ejus
    <lb ed="#V" n="24"/>perfectio relucet in operibus 
    restau<lb ed="#V" n="25" break="no"/>rationis. Et circa primam 
    distinctio<lb ed="#V" n="26" break="no"/>nem hujus tertii quaeruntur 
    quin<lb ed="#V" n="27" break="no"/>que : Primo, utrum possibile fuerit
    <lb ed="#V" n="28"/>naturam humanam uniri Verbo in
    <lb ed="#V" n="29"/>unitate suppositi. Secundo, utrum
    <lb ed="#V" n="30"/>res personae possint assumere 
    eam<lb ed="#V" n="31" break="no"/>dem naturam numero. Tertio, utrum
    <lb ed="#V" n="32"/>una persona possit assumere plures
    <lb ed="#V" n="33"/>naturas. Quarto, utrum suppositum
    <lb ed="#V" n="34"/>creatum possit sustentificare 
    hypos<lb ed="#V" n="35" break="no"/>tatice allam naturam creatam. 
    Quin<lb ed="#V" n="36" break="no"/>to, utrum formalis ratio terminandi
    <lb ed="#V" n="37"/>istam unionem sit proprietas 
    rela<lb ed="#V" n="38" break="no"/>tiva.
  </p>
         </div>
